mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(surface)\" title=\"Acid (surface)\">Acid</a></span> surface on impact. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pseudopod\" title=\"Pseudopod\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pseudopod\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pseudopod\" title=\"Pseudopod\">Pseudopod</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Lash out with a slimy grey tentacle. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/40px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/60px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/80px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/40px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\">Gather Your Allies (class action)</a></span>\n</p><p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>By gaining <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png/25px-Portrait_Ox.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png/38px-Portrait_Ox.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png/50px-Portrait_Ox.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strange Ox\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png/25px-Portrait_Ox.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\">Strange Ox</a> as an ally, during <a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gather Your Allies\">Gather Your Allies</a> by completing <a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Devilish_Ox\" title=\"Help the Devilish Ox\">Help the Devilish Ox</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715045902\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.118 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.124 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5117/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 108876/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 41964/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1589676/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n154.35%  154.157     51 Template:Trim\n100.00%   99.876      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   99.876      1 -total\n 35.83%   35.787      6 Template:Spell_action\n 19.62%   19.597      6 Template:Spell_action/format\n 18.99%   18.964     13 Template:Icon_text\n 12.51%   12.497      1 Template:Creature\n 11.61%   11.600      5 Template:Template_style\n 10.62%   10.608      7 Template:Resource\n  9.93%    9.918      1 Template:Creature/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:24414-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715045902 and revision id 375703. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}